# stackguardian_role (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Migrating to `stackguardian_rolev4`

This resource combines every permission path with every other path, which produces more
permissions than most configurations intend.
[`stackguardian_rolev4`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/rolev4) maps paths one to one instead, and its page has a side-by-side
migration example.

## Granting a role

A role does nothing until it is granted. Use a
[`stackguardian_role_assignment`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/role_assignment), whose `role` or `roles` values are this
resource's `resource_name`.

