## Import

Import existing resource.

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_role.example-role
  id = "role-name"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_role.example-role role-name
```

